      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.1,
          "end": 4.16,
          "en": "Now, rendering our list like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.16,
          "end": 6.21,
          "en": "is of course not our goal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.21,
          "end": 8.09,
          "en": "We want to render a more beautiful,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.09,
          "end": 10.22,
          "en": "a more good looking list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.22,
          "end": 14.66,
          "en": "And for this we could structure our code here differently",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.66,
          "end": 16.59,
          "en": "and add more styling,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.59,
          "end": 20.32,
          "en": "but ultimately I simply want to create a new component here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.32,
          "end": 23.21,
          "en": "and add component specific styling.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.21,
          "end": 24.69,
          "en": "So that's what we'll do.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 24.69,
          "end": 28,
          "en": "In the components folder I'll add another subfolder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 28,
          "end": 30.63,
          "en": "next to layout, and I'll name it meetups.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 30.63,
          "end": 34.03,
          "en": "And this holds all my meetup specific code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 34.03,
          "end": 37.6,
          "en": "And in there I'll add a MeetupItem.js file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 37.6,
          "end": 41.18,
          "en": "and a MeetupList.js file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 41.18,
          "end": 43.55,
          "en": "because I want to outsource both the list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 43.55,
          "end": 46.04,
          "en": "as well as the individual list items",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 46.04,
          "end": 48.01,
          "en": "into components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 48.01,
          "end": 51.26,
          "en": "Because, as mentioned earlier, it is a good practice to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 51.26,
          "end": 54.7,
          "en": "split your components and your application as a whole",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 54.7,
          "end": 57.94,
          "en": "into small, reusable pieces.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 57.94,
          "end": 60.35,
          "en": "Now let's start with the MeetupItem.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 60.35,
          "end": 64.35,
          "en": "In that file, we create our MeetupItem function of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 64.35,
          "end": 65.7,
          "en": "as we did before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 65.7,
          "end": 68.909,
          "en": "and we export that function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 68.909,
          "end": 72.72,
          "en": "Then in here, we return a list item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 72.72,
          "end": 76.21000000000001,
          "en": "And then in that list item, I want to have a div,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 76.21000000000001,
          "end": 80.13,
          "en": "in which I render the image and set the source to something",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 80.13,
          "end": 82.62,
          "en": "and the alt text to something,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 82.62,
          "end": 85.57,
          "en": "and then that's a self-closing element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 85.57,
          "end": 90.03999999999999,
          "en": "and below that div I have another div with the content,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 90.03999999999999,
          "end": 94.22,
          "en": "where I have a h3 tag with the title,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 94.22,
          "end": 98.41,
          "en": "an address tag, which is a default html tag,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 98.41,
          "end": 101.87,
          "en": "where I output the address later,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 101.87,
          "end": 105.6,
          "en": "and then a paragraph with the description.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 105.6,
          "end": 108.33,
          "en": "And all this hard coded text will of course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 108.33,
          "end": 111.74000000000001,
          "en": "soon be replaced with dynamic data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 111.74000000000001,
          "end": 114.24000000000001,
          "en": "And then below that we can add another div",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 114.24000000000001,
          "end": 119.24000000000001,
          "en": "with a button, where we say to Favorites,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 119.37,
          "end": 124.18,
          "en": "so that this adds the item to our Favorites later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 124.18,
          "end": 127.71,
          "en": "That's the general structure I want to have here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 127.71,
          "end": 130.85,
          "en": "Now as mentioned, title, address, and description,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 130.85,
          "end": 134.34,
          "en": "and also the data for the image, should be dynamic.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 134.34,
          "end": 136.82,
          "en": "I don't want to hard code it here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 136.82,
          "end": 140.68,
          "en": "Instead, it should be passed in from outside,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 140.68,
          "end": 143.27,
          "en": "from the so-called parent component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 143.27,
          "end": 146.02,
          "en": "so the component where we use this component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 146.02,
          "end": 148.18,
          "en": "in its jsx code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 148.18,
          "end": 150.825,
          "en": "And we learned how we can make that happen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 150.825,
          "end": 154.72,
          "en": "we can accept props here and use props.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 154.72,
          "end": 157.81,
          "en": "And then for example, for the image source,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 157.81,
          "end": 161.03,
          "en": "we could set this to props.image,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 161.03,
          "end": 164.05,
          "en": "expecting a image prop on the MeetupItem,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 164.05,
          "end": 169.05,
          "en": "which holds that URL that should be set as a source here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 169.17000000000002,
          "end": 173,
          "en": "And the same for the alt text that could be our title.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 173,
          "end": 175.17000000000002,
          "en": "The title can also be used down there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 175.17000000000002,
          "end": 178.53,
          "en": "so that'd be output props.title here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 178.53,
          "end": 182.04,
          "en": "And for the address, it's props.address.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 182.04,
          "end": 186.083,
          "en": "For the description, it's props.description.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 187.35,
          "end": 191.07,
          "en": "And now, all of a sudden this component is reusable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 191.07,
          "end": 192.223,
          "en": "and dynamic.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 193.48,
          "end": 195.86,
          "en": "Some styling would also be nice, and for that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 195.86,
          "end": 199.29,
          "en": "again attach, you find css files here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 199.29,
          "end": 201.82999999999998,
          "en": "the meetupitem.module css",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 201.82999999999998,
          "end": 205.14,
          "en": "and the meetuplist.module css files,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 205.14,
          "end": 210.14,
          "en": "which you can copy in next to these JavaScript files,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 210.3,
          "end": 213.54399999999998,
          "en": "and then in meetupitem.js we want to import",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 213.54399999999998,
          "end": 218.54399999999998,
          "en": "classes from./meetupitem.module.css",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 220.34,
          "end": 224.66,
          "en": "and assign a couple of classes in that JavaScript file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 224.66,
          "end": 226.35,
          "en": "On the list item for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 226.35,
          "end": 231.35,
          "en": "we'll add the item class like this on this div,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 231.78,
          "end": 233.3,
          "en": "which is wrapped around the image,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 233.3,
          "end": 237.68,
          "en": "we'll add the image class like this on the div",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 237.68,
          "end": 241.37,
          "en": "which is wrapped around the title and description and so on,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 241.37,
          "end": 243.454,
          "en": "we'll add the content class,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 243.454,
          "end": 247.363,
          "en": "and then down there, for the button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 248.63,
          "end": 252.263,
          "en": "I'll add a class of actions, like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 253.87,
          "end": 257.06,
          "en": "Now that's not all. I also want to work on that MeetupList",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 257.06,
          "end": 258.97,
          "en": "component already.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 258.97,
          "end": 261.912,
          "en": "So here we can again create another component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 261.912,
          "end": 266.73,
          "en": "MeetupList, and export that as a default.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 266.73,
          "end": 269.64,
          "en": "Also accept props here, because I expect",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 269.64,
          "end": 272.9,
          "en": "to get that list data from outside as well,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 272.9,
          "end": 275.07,
          "en": "and I'm expecting this because I'm the one",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 275.07,
          "end": 276.53,
          "en": "building this app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 276.53,
          "end": 279.62,
          "en": "We could also write the code for fetching meetups",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 279.62,
          "end": 283.53,
          "en": "in this component, but I instead want to make this component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 283.53,
          "end": 287.87,
          "en": "reusable and not care about the data source in here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 287.87,
          "end": 290.5,
          "en": "but instead just expect that I get meetups",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 290.5,
          "end": 291.83,
          "en": "through some prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 291.83,
          "end": 295.19,
          "en": "and then it's a component which uses the MeetupList",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 295.19,
          "end": 298.99,
          "en": "component that has to worry about getting the meetups.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 298.99,
          "end": 300.61,
          "en": "And I'm setting it up like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 300.61,
          "end": 303.8,
          "en": "because I plan on using the MeetupList component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 303.8,
          "end": 305.97,
          "en": "in the AllMeetups component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 305.97,
          "end": 308.78,
          "en": "and also in the Favorites component later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 308.78,
          "end": 311.694,
          "en": "And there we'll have different data sources,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 311.694,
          "end": 314.64,
          "en": "but the same way of displaying the data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 314.64,
          "end": 316.6,
          "en": "And that's what we can make work",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 316.6,
          "end": 319.883,
          "en": "by adding a separate reusable component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 321.48,
          "end": 325.41,
          "en": "In here I also already wanna import classes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 325.41,
          "end": 330.02,
          "en": "from ./MeetupList.module.css,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 330.02,
          "end": 332.432,
          "en": "and return an unordered list here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 332.432,
          "end": 336.72,
          "en": "which receives a class name of classes.list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 337.59000000000003,
          "end": 342.59000000000003,
          "en": "which is the only provided css class for this component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 344.05,
          "end": 346.65,
          "en": "And inside of the unordered list here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 346.65,
          "end": 349.832,
          "en": "I now wanna output my MeetupItems",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 349.832,
          "end": 353,
          "en": "in the same way we did it in AllMeetups,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 353,
          "end": 356.17,
          "en": "by mapping an array of objects",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 356.17,
          "end": 359.07,
          "en": "into an array of jsx elements.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 359.07,
          "end": 364.07,
          "en": "Just that the jsx elements will now be the list items.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 365.16,
          "end": 368.63,
          "en": "And for this here we again add a dynamic expression",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 368.63,
          "end": 369.952,
          "en": "with curly braces,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 369.952,
          "end": 373.29,
          "en": "and we can expect that on our props here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 373.29,
          "end": 377.094,
          "en": "in MeetupList, we get, let's say, a meetups prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 377.094,
          "end": 380.25,
          "en": "the name is up to you, because it's your component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 380.25,
          "end": 382.83,
          "en": "this could all be named items,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 382.83,
          "end": 384.99,
          "en": "but here I'll go with meetups.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 384.99,
          "end": 389.173,
          "en": "And then I'll map every meetup into another object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 390.04,
          "end": 392.75,
          "en": "Into a jsx element, to be precise.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 392.75,
          "end": 395.7,
          "en": "So therefore, using the arrow function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 395.7,
          "end": 397.75,
          "en": "shorthand subtext here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 397.75,
          "end": 401.37,
          "en": "I'll transform every meetup into a MeetupItem.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 403.75,
          "end": 406.14,
          "en": "And for this, you need to add this import.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 406.14,
          "end": 409.65,
          "en": "It was automatically added for me here by the IDE.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 409.65,
          "end": 412.76,
          "en": "If that does not work for you, just add it manually,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 412.76,
          "end": 416.423,
          "en": "and import MeetupItem from the MeetupItem file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 417.73,
          "end": 420.57,
          "en": "Now we render one MeetupItem per object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 420.57,
          "end": 422.35,
          "en": "in the meetups array,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 422.35,
          "end": 424.5,
          "en": "and that now needs to be configured.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 424.5,
          "end": 427.47,
          "en": "It needs this key prop, this special prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 427.47,
          "end": 431.65,
          "en": "React expects, one of the very few special props",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 431.65,
          "end": 434.93,
          "en": "that are built into React, and that can be used",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
